          "n": 1,
          "text": "CRITICAL NOTICE.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "IN preparing the text of the present edition of the Nîtis'ataka,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "altogether fifteen different copies have been consulted. Of these,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "six copies are printed, and the remaining nine are MSS. The",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "printed copies are the following :—",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "C. The Bombay Oblong edition, lithographed and accompanied",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "by a commentary. I have generally followed its text.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "T. The Bombay edition accompanied by a translation into",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "Marâṭhi. After I had prepared my text and Variæ lectiones, I",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "found that there had been more than one edition with a trans-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "lation into Marâṭhi printed. But I did not consider it either",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "necessary or useful to consult these other editions.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "Bo. The edition of Bohlen. I have also made use of the Variæ",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "lectiones e codicibus Chambersianis petitæ collected by A. Weber",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "and appended at the close of Bohlen’s volume. These I have",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "called ‘Bo.n.’",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "Be. The copy in Benfey’s Chrestomathie. I have also made",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "use of the various readings. They are called ‘Be.n.’",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "K. The copy in the Kâvyasangraha recently printed at Cal-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "cutta. This work seems to be very much like a reprint of",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "Hæberlin’s anthology, and it will be found that, in the majority",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "of cases at least, the reading in ‘K.’ and in Be.n. (which is from",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "Hæberlin) coincide.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "N. A copy of the three S'atakas of Bhartṛihari printed in",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "Telugu characters. This copy has been sent me by my friend",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "Mr. V. N. Narasimmiengar of Bangalore who tells me that this",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "copy represents the recension universally current in the South.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    }
  ],
